title: 'spec-msg: XCM routing on the enactment stack'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: Route XCM through speculative messaging and preserve its origin through message queue
    processing. If the speculative messaging channel closes during HRMP cutover, new sends
    fail until it reopens or the runtime clears the HRMP closing flag. Transaction sends must fit
    both the normal-class and total block limits, including the congestion fee update.
crates:
- name: cumulus-pallet-spec-messaging
  bump: major
- name: parachains-common
  bump: major
- name: bridge-hub-common
  bump: major
- name: cumulus-primitives-core
  bump: major
